/S /H5
/T (The current objective was to streamline the microservice-based platform. As demand for more microsevice based applications grew they found it hard to scale and deploy services on the docker swarm platform.)
/E (The current objective was to streamline the microservice-based platform. As demand for more microsevice based applications grew they found it hard to scale and deploy services on the docker swarm platform.)
